  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I think this game could really use more options for keyboard users. What really drew me to this game was the way you could really interact with the world around you.However, most VR systems are quite expensive. I think that adding more options for keyboard would make the playerbase of the game grow exponentially. If we had the ability to move our arms and crouch, even those small things would add so much to this great game. It really helps bring the community together if we could all engage in the non-verbal aspects of communication or grant more details for avatar creators to some up with even more amazing avatars. I understand that there are hardware limitations but we could surely work something out.",
